14. IMPLEMENTATION PRIORITY — V1
====================================================

Build order should be:

Fas 1
- validation rules
- weightStatus
- rebalanceStatus

Fas 2
- trendStatus using 20/65/200d returns
- basic debug payload

Fas 3
- riskStatus using:
  - volatility
  - drawdown
  - concentration if available
  - cyclicality/speculation base score

Fas 4
- total risk aggregation
- dry powder status

Fas 5
- hedgeStatus
- total hedge signal
- graceful degradation polish

====================================================
15. EXPLICIT V1-GRÄNS
====================================================

The following are intentionally simplified in V1 and may förbättras later:
- trend via simple horizon returns rather than richer technical model
- risk via additive score rather than optimized multifactor model
- hedge mapping via policy + risk/trend + optional overlay
- dry powder via threshold table tied to total risk
- concentration mainly via top holding weight
- cyclicality via portfolioType-aware heuristics

This is acceptable because V1 prioritizes:
- determinism
- explainability
- implementation safety
- low guess-risk for Codex

